We took remote session of the user and found that user had done duplicate entries in employee masters and wants to delete it ,
to do so we have perform below queries in SQL,
Select * from EmpMaster where code in ('1001, '1002', '1003', '1004', '1005', '1006', '1007', '1008', '1009');
delete from EmpMaster where code in ('1001, '1002', '1003', '1004', '1005', '1006', '1007', '1008', '1009'); 
Select * from AllUserr where Empcode in ('1001, '1002', '1003', '1004', '1005', '1006', '1007', '1008', '1009');
delete from AllUser where Empcode in ('1001, '1002', '1003', '1004', '1005', '1006', '1007', '1008', '1009');

