Solution: If attendance is showing in the database with X flag, it needs to be processed to P. After that, attendance should show in the spreadsheet in the iApp application.
Please follow below steps.
select count( * )from AttdDetails where processflag='X';
update AttdDetails set processflag='P' where processflag='X';
(57 records affected.)This is for information.

