comments:
1. The client reported that attendance data for June 16, 2024, is not showing in the attendance sheet. I opened the attendance record of the employee and found that the punches were not showing. I then went to the miscellaneous menu to check all the transactions for that day and found attendance transactions, but they were not showing in the attendance sheet. 2. I accessed the Zydus server to check which flag is showing for the transactions on that particular date. 
3. I opened the database and executed the following queries:
SELECT * FROM empmaster WHERE code='124316'; 
SELECT * FROM attddetails WHERE empid='' AND attddate='2024/06/16'; 
4. I found an 'X' flag for 4 attendance punches, so I modified the process flag in SQL DBX and updated the flag to 'P'. 
5. I opened the attendance sheet, and now all the attendance data is showing properly.

