We took a remote session with the user and found that one of their employees' attendance sheets was not reflecting in ARS Win Net. We checked the employee master, and the employee details were not available there either. 

We asked the user for the employee's joining date, which is December 26, 2023. The user has multiple companies, so this employee is recorded in the year 2023 and has not yet been moved to 2024. We installed SQL DBX to update the employee record for the year 2024.

The following SQL queries were executed:

```sql
SELECT * FROM dbo.emp WHERE cardid='14911381';

INSERT INTO dbo.emp (active, add1, add2, alldate, applied, bg, bod, cardid, categ, city, confdate, country, deptid, desig, dop, dot, email, empid, empname, grade, indexx, jod, lvgrp, mstatus, offday1, offday2, pincode, resdate, sex, spouse, state, telno, strMgr1, strMgr2, strMgr3, strMgr4, strMgr5, ShftGrp, ResReason, PFNo, PAN, ResType, Location, Loc1, Loc2, Loc3, Loc4, Loc5, BUnit, FatherName, BusRoute, EmergencyPhone, CostCentre, Area, BankACID, BankName, Branch, IFSCCode, InsuranceNo, SAPId)
VALUES ('0', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-26', '3', NULL, '1998-03-26', '14911381', 'Staff', NULL, NULL, NULL, '590', 'M12', NULL, NULL, NULL, '00016666', 'Ankit Sunil Padale', 'Grade', 128, '2023-12-26', 'Staf1', '2', '0', '7', '', NULL, '2', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MORA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Na', 'Sunil Padale', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);

-- Now the user is visible in ARS Win Net, but his attendance is marked in Communicator Soft. To transfer the attendance data to ARS Win Net, we performed the following queries:

UPDATE dbo.emp SET alldate=NULL WHERE cardid='14911381';

SELECT * FROM TransactionData WHERE EmployeeID='16666' AND entryDtTime BETWEEN '2024-01-01 00:00:00' AND '2024-08-07 23:59:00';

UPDATE TransactionData SET flgConfig1=NULL WHERE EmployeeID='16666' AND entryDtTime BETWEEN '2024-01-01 00:00:00' AND '2024-08-07 23:59:00';
```

